This file is the compiled WebAssembly module of the `tree-sitter-twig`
grammar published as `tree-sitter-twig@0.8.2` on npm. It is vendored here
rather than installed from npm because the upstream package's `install`
script (`node-gyp rebuild`) fails on machines without a C/C++ build
toolchain even though only the prebuilt `.wasm` is actually needed.

Source: https://github.com/kaermorchen/tree-sitter-twig
License: MPL-2.0
